 ## Languages

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
-`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server selects `en` or `ko` from the request's
+`Accept-Language` header, using the highest positive q-value (default 1).
+Region tags such as `ko-KR` are supported; ties use header order.
+If no supported preference is present, it uses `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+Preferences with q=0 are ignored. Every error code has both translations,
+including unexpected server errors (`internal`, status 500).
